  "claim": "From 2015 to 2016, the star of the show Gillian in Georgia, starred in a Starz show set in the \"Evil Dead\" universe created by Ivan Raimi.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Jill Marie Jones. Sentence: Jill Marie Jones (born January 4, 1975) is an American actress and former professional dancer and cheerleader.\nPage: Jill Marie Jones. Sentence: From 2015 to 2016, she starred as Amanda Fisher in the Starz horror-comedy series, \"Ash vs Evil Dead\".\nPage: Ash vs Evil Dead. Sentence: Ash vs Evil Dead is an American horror comedy television series developed by Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi, and Tom Spezialy for the Starz network.\nPage: Ash vs Evil Dead. Sentence: It is set in Raimi's \"Evil Dead\" universe, with Bruce Campbell reprising his role as Ash Williams, and acts as a sequel to the original trilogy.\nPage: Gillian in Georgia. Sentence: The show stars Jill Marie Jones, Shondrella Avery, Darrin Dewitt Henson and James Mathis III.",
