        "original_id": "c3456395-f001-5251-9d50-79dfcd963098",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jill Marie Jones, Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi, Tom Spezialy, Bruce Campbell, Shondrella Avery, Darrin Dewitt Henson, James Mathis III\n- Works: Ash vs Evil Dead, Evil Dead, Gillian in Georgia\n- Organizations: Starz\n- Roles: Amanda Fisher, Ash Williams\n\nFacts:\n- Jill Marie Jones was born on January 4, 1975, and she is an American actress and former professional dancer and cheerleader.\n- Ash vs Evil Dead is an American horror-comedy television series developed by Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi, and Tom Spezialy for Starz.\n- Ash vs Evil Dead is set in Sam Raimi's Evil Dead universe, and Bruce Campbell reprises his role as Ash Williams in the series, which serves as a sequel to the original trilogy.\n- From 2015 to 2016, Jill Marie Jones starred as Amanda Fisher in the Starz horror-comedy series Ash vs Evil Dead.\n- Gillian in Georgia stars Jill Marie Jones, Shondrella Avery, Darrin Dewitt Henson, and James Mathis III.",
